  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "json: Fix --no-duplicate-keys field grouping for text-only nodes",
  "description": "proto_node_to_json_key() returns hfinfo->abbrev for normal fields\n(same pointer for same field) but finfo->rep->representation for\nhf_text_only nodes (different pointer per instance). Using\ng_direct_hash/g_direct_equal compared pointer identity, so text-only\nnodes with identical keys were never grouped together, producing\nduplicate JSON keys and missing merged fields.\n\nSwitch to g_str_hash/g_str_equal to compare string content instead\nof pointer address.\n\nFix: 6520474bc9\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Kiro)",
